@references

Purpose:
  Reusable engineering knowledge. AI loads these once and references
  them across projects instead of re-deriving concepts.

Use this index before introducing any conceptual approach.

Navigation:
  DDD: @ddd
  Architecture: @architecture
  Patterns: @patterns
  Database: @database
  Engineering: @engineering
  BestPractices: @best-practices

DecisionGuide:
  Need domain modeling?
    → @ddd

  Need system structure?
    → @architecture

  Need reusable solution?
    → @patterns

  Need data management?
    → @database

  Need engineering principles?
    → @engineering

  Need default heuristics?
    → @best-practices

